      ],
      "en": "In rebellion, a land has many rulers, but order is maintained by a man of understanding and knowledge.",
      "ko": "나라는 죄가 있으면 주관자가 많아져도 명철과 지식 있는 사람으로 말미암아 장구하게 되느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "4272d6c7e7daed5505c1c756dee8f85586e27f58d6175102ad7a69f0711f1332",
      "translation_text_hash": "d9836e034d6538f56b16333f0af7775c73483302ce2da7d74e72e129efec53d0",
